    "detailed_description": "<h1>Time is running out!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/b464ffeda1626ebc178d0f90ae67fdbf.avif?t=1687081647\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/e5d4cb4d7fda17bde9bbb8334b6232a7.avif?t=1687081647\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/b6b8204b462d70ba98384646b5335eaa.poster.avif?t=1687081647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/b6b8204b462d70ba98384646b5335eaa.webm?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/b6b8204b462d70ba98384646b5335eaa.mp4?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Team Five is an online, over-the-top turn-based battle where the clock is always against you!<br>Battle it out against your friends, each with a team of five animals with special abilities.<br>Collect all the loot you can, but don't get too greedy because when your five minutes run out - THE WORLD ENDS.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/2cdff44f08fa39e2fae71fef5aaf8706.poster.avif?t=1687081647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/2cdff44f08fa39e2fae71fef5aaf8706.webm?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/2cdff44f08fa39e2fae71fef5aaf8706.mp4?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Let loose with a vast arsenal of customizable weapons!<br>Craft your own arsenal of destruction, upgrading and enhancing your weapons to maximum capacity.<br>Rain chaos upon the map, obliterating everything in sight, yourself included!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/86b41ea30041ba9bf59ac94ddc669dc5.poster.avif?t=1687081647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/86b41ea30041ba9bf59ac94ddc669dc5.webm?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/86b41ea30041ba9bf59ac94ddc669dc5.mp4?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Once you've returned with your spoils, you can meet with the mysterious vendor, the animal that's been through it all.<br>In return for your collected goods, he's willing to give you his treasures.<br>Get powerful weapons, new furious animals, and cool gadgets \u2014 everything so that your next venture will be even more fruitful.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/680a36ff5cf9f8f17302088199fe7f4c.poster.avif?t=1687081647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/680a36ff5cf9f8f17302088199fe7f4c.webm?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/680a36ff5cf9f8f17302088199fe7f4c.mp4?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Five Animals: Command your animals to kill and be killed while exploiting their special abilities and playstyles.<br></li><li> Five Exits: Collect all the scattered loot, as you compete with your enemy over which animals get to leave the battlezone.<br></li><li> Five Minutes: Experience the frantic thrill of a time-limited battle where every decision must be swift and calculated.<br></li><li> Intense online multiplayer battles: Challenge your friends or engage in competitive matches with players from around the world.<br></li><li> Explosive weaponry: Customize and upgrade your weapons to unleash devastating firepower upon your opponents and the environment.<br></li><li> Dynamic maps: Annihilate the map and witness its transformation as you unleash chaos upon it.<br></li><li> Unlimited strategies: Discover endless tactical possibilities as you experiment with different animal combinations and strategic approaches.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/b6b8204b462d70ba98384646b5335eaa.poster.avif?t=1687081647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/b6b8204b462d70ba98384646b5335eaa.webm?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/b6b8204b462d70ba98384646b5335eaa.mp4?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Team Five is an online, over-the-top turn-based battle where the clock is always against you!<br>Battle it out against your friends, each with a team of five animals with special abilities.<br>Collect all the loot you can, but don't get too greedy because when your five minutes run out - THE WORLD ENDS.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/2cdff44f08fa39e2fae71fef5aaf8706.poster.avif?t=1687081647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/2cdff44f08fa39e2fae71fef5aaf8706.webm?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/2cdff44f08fa39e2fae71fef5aaf8706.mp4?t=1687081647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Let loose with a vast arsenal of customizable weapons!<br>Craft your own arsenal of destruction, upgrading and enhancing your weapons to maximum capacity.<br>Rain chaos upon the map, obliterating everything in sight, yourself included!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284160/extras/86b41ea30041ba9bf59ac94ddc669dc5.pos