r opponents and the environment.<br></li><li> Dynamic maps: Annihilate the map and witness its transformation as you unleash chaos upon it.<br></li><li> Unlimited strategies: Discover endless tactical possibilities as you experiment with different animal combinations and strategic approaches.</li></ul>",
